kien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-02-02T00:02:33Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T11:21:14Z","closed_at":"2026-03-14T11:21:13Z","assignee":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.stable, 4.5.1.stable, 4.4.1.stable, 4.3.stable (since Wayland support was added)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable unknown - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 24 Jan 2026 00:47:39 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT (radeonsi, navi10, LLVM 21.1.6, DRM 3.64, 6.18.7-arch1-1) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.26 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn Wayland, Godot crashes with an `unconfigured_buffer` protocol error whenever a window is created and the initial configure arrives delayed.\n\nThese two bits\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/98782b6c8c9cabe0fb7c80bc62640735ecb076d3/platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_thread.cpp#L3898-L3899\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/98782b6c8c9cabe0fb7c80bc62640735ecb076d3/platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_thread.cpp#L3987-L3988\n\nassume the initial configure is sent immediately and will arrive within the roundtrip. The protocol doesn't specify that this must be immediate, however, and I've been writing a Wayland compositor that delays initial configures in certain circumstances. In this case a buffer gets attached and committed before the configure + ACK leading to the error.\n\nWAYLAND_DEBUG log: [wayland_debug.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24997096/wayland_debug.log)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI haven't run into another compositor that delays initial configures, so these steps use my own, [Pinnacle](https://github.com/pinnacle-comp/pinnacle). For reproducibility, these steps delay by a large amount (1 second), but in real-world use the delay is short enough that Godot only crashes some times and not others.\n\nFor those who use Arch btw:\n1. Get Pinnacle from the AUR.\n    ```bash\n    yay -S pinnacle-comp\n    ```\n2. Start it.\n    ```bash\n    pinnacle\n    ```\n3. In a terminal inside the compositor:\n    ```bash\n    pinnacle client -e \"Pinnacle.setup(function() Window.add_window_rule(function(_) os.execute('sleep 1') end) end)\"\n    ```\n    This will delay the initial configure by a second.\n4. Start Godot. It will crash with the aforementioned protocol error.\n\nOther distros:\n1. Build from source ([requires ALL dependencies listed here](https://pinnacle-comp.github.io/pinnacle/getting-started/installation#dependencies)):\n    ```bash\n    git clone https://github.com/pinnacle-comp/pinnacle --depth 1\n    cd pinnacle\n    just install build\n    ```\n2. Start it.\n    ```bash\n    just run\n    ```\n3. In a terminal inside the compositor:\n    ```bash\n    just run -- client -e \"\\\"Pinnacle.setup(function() Window.add_window_rule(function(_) os.execute('sleep 1') end) end)\\\"\"\n    ```\n    This will delay the initial configure by a second.\n4. Start Godot. It will crash with the aforementioned protocol error.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115739/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115739/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}